+  // The "--type=clone-cleanup" helper process is launched from the browser
+  // process as soon as the clone exists, and lives as long as the browser
+  // does. Wait until the parent browser process dies to ensure the clone is
+  // not being used. A kqueue exit event costs no wakeups over a whole browser
